cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the trained agents, please cite it using the metadata below (and the associated manuscript once published)."
type: software
title: "Code, trained agents and processed results for: Certificate-Enforcing Adaptive Disturbance-Observer Sliding-Mode Control with Safety-Filtered Reinforcement-Learning Supervision for Battery-Supercapacitor Electric Vehicles"
abstract: >-
  Python simulation of a battery-supercapacitor hybrid energy storage system with a two-tier
  controller: an adaptive disturbance-observer sliding-mode controller that enforces its reaching
  condition online (tier 1) and a safety-filtered TD3 supervisor (tier 2). The repository contains
  the simulator, the NumPy TD3 implementation, trained actors, processed results and the scripts
  that regenerate every table and figure of the manuscript.
